    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PATRIZIA: That’s a beautiful tree.\nPAOLA FRANCHI: We put it up this morning. We wanted to surprise you. It’s such a pleasure to meet you. I’m Paola. An old friend of M’s.\nPATRIZIA: M? Cute. I’m sure you know my name.",
      "ALLEGRA: With a credit card!\nPATRIZIA: We can change the strap if you don’t like that color.",
      "PATRIZIA: You are a waste of skin that belongs on the front page of every newspaper. I want the world to know what you are really like. I am not going…\nPATRIZIA: Loving you was like loving the dead.\nPAOLA CHIARI: Who was it, my love?",
      "PATRIZIA: I don’t tolerate lateness.\nPINA AURIEMMA: I told Patrizia I’ve known you since childhood. We trust you.",
      "PINA AURIEMMA: I can’t go in with you.\nPATRIZIA: Just tell me which hotel it is.\nPINA AURIEMMA: There are consequences to this. For both of us. I don’t want you to go.\nPATRIZIA: Pina, I’m going to do it anyway, with or without you. So either you help me and we do this responsibly and efficiently, or you get in my way…"
    ]
  },
